<title>USA: U.S. stock index futures finish up strongly.</title>
<headline>U.S. stock index futures finish up strongly.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 8 - U.S. stock index futures ended up strongly after daily peaks late on earnings optimism. Traders cite Intl Paper earnings, P&amp;G news and high hopes for Motorola Q2 results. Sept S&amp;P reaches 928.80, but remains within Monday's range. Traders said volume brisk late, lackluster overall on the day.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312) 408-8750))</p>
